    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa diwu mawuswana atambwiluwu anyana kaIsarela mwituŋa daKenani, ayibalwililuwu kudi kapristu Eleyazari, nimwana kaNuni Yoshuwa, niakulumpi jawatata janyichidi yawanyana kaIsarela, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwomwasakwililuwu wuswana wawu nachinjikijilu chakusakula nachu, mwomwashimwiniyi Yehova kukanwa kaMosi, wanyichidi yitanu nayiwana, namuchidi wachibalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulopa wuswana wanyichidi yiyedi namuchidi wachibalu Mosi wayinkeluwu dehi mwishinadi daYodana. Ilaŋa aLevi hayinkeli wuswana mukachi kawuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulopa anyana kaYosefu adiŋi nyichidi yiyedi, iwu Manase, iwu Efweremi. ALevi hiyayinkeli iseka dawu mwituŋaku, wayinkeli kwanyikala yakushakama hohu, nimpata janyepumukaku jakudiishila yimuna yawu nŋayuma yawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwalejeluwu Mosi kudi Yehova dimu mweliluwu anyana kaIsarela, abalwili ituŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henahana anyana kaYuda aswilili kwakwihi naYoshuwa hadipiyi kuGiligali. Mwana kaYefune Kalebi kaKenizi hakumwila nindi, Eyi weluka chuma chamwililuwu muntu waNzambi Mosi kudi Yehova, chakutena ninami nineyi muKadeshi Baraneya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hana hantemesheliyi kambuŋaYehova Mosi, nifumi muKadeshi Baraneya niyi nakwendesha ituŋa; nadipi kwami wanyaka makumi awana. Namuleteleli cheŋi izu dadipi mumuchima wami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila ana kwami nayili nawu anowesheli nyichima yawantu, ilaŋa ami kwami namulondeli Yehova Nzambi yami hachikupu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosi wasanyikili ifuku odu nindi, Chalala, ituŋa diwadatili mwendu weyi deyeyi nawanyaneyi aawuswana haya nyaka, nanichi chiwunalondi Yehova Nzambi yami hachikupu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu tala, Yehova nanhandishi wumi wami iyi nyaka makumi awana nanyaka yitanu mwomwahosheliyi, kufumisha hana hahosheliyi Yehova naMosi izu idi, hendeluwu aIsarela mwisaŋa; ichi dinu tala, lelu nashiki munyaka makumi atanu nasatu nanyaka yitanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelu saŋa nakolela neyi chinadiŋilaŋa ifuku dantemesheliyi Mosi; mwashikili Ŋovu yami henahana dimu munashiki Ŋovu yami nikatataka, hela yakwasa nachu njita, hela yakwenda nachu, hela yakukoŋa nachu nyidimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu nyinki mpidi iyi yateneniyi Yehova denodu ifuku, muloŋa ichi dena ifuku dina eyi aweni watiyili nawu kudi aAnaki, nawu kudi ninyikalayamaneni yakujika mpwembu; wamba kela Yehova nukwikala nindi, hinakayitemunamu, mwahosheliyi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshuwa wamukiswilili nkisu, wamwinkeli mwana kaYefune Kalebi kaKenizi, Heberoni, nindi yiikali wuswana windi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Heberoni yelili wuswana wambala wamwana kaYefune Kalebi kaKenizi nilelu yindi, nanochu chalondeliyi Yehova Nzambi yaIsarela hachikupu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nochu ijina daHeberoni hakusambila dadiŋi Kiriyati Araba; yenowu Araba wadiŋi wabadika akwawu aAnaki kutoha. Mwituŋa mumwena ninjita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
